<title>ZAIRE: Mobutu's plane lands in Kinshasa.</title>
<headline>Mobutu's plane lands in Kinshasa.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ailing President Mobutu Sese Seko's plane landed in Zaire's capital on Friday but the president did not immediately appear, witnesses said.</p>
<p>A welcoming committee and presidential guard of honour beside the red carpet pulled back after a wait of about 20 minutes, they added.</p>
